       warning message is the Postfix version that introduced the last  incom‐
       patible  change.  The  level  is  formatted as _m_a_j_o_r_._m_i_n_o_r_._p_a_t_c_h, where
       _p_a_t_c_h is usually omitted and defaults to  zero.  Earlier  compatibility
       levels are 0, 1 and 2.

