       mail on. Specify "all" to receive mail on all network  interfaces  (de‐
       fault),  and "loopback-only" to receive mail on loopback network inter‐
       faces only (Postfix version 2.2 and later).  The  parameter  also  con‐
       trols delivery of mail to user@[ip.address].

