       that  return  a  list  of allowed envelope sender patterns separated by
       space or comma. These sender patterns are enforced by the Postfix ppoosstt‐‐
       ddrroopp(1) command. The default is backwards-compatible:  every  user  may
       specify any sender envelope address.

