       weight  factors. When the list is non-empty, the ddnnssbblloogg(8) daemon will
       query these domains with the  reversed  IP  addresses  of  remote  SMTP
       clients,  and  ppoossttssccrreeeenn(8)  will  update an SMTP client’s DNSBL score
