              any non-error DNSBL query result.  Otherwise, ppoossttssccrreeeenn(8) will
              use only DNSBL query results that match the filter.  The  filter
              has the form d.d.d.d, where each d is a number, or a pattern in‐
              side  [] that contains one or more ";"-separated numbers or num‐
              ber..number ranges.

