       tables are searched while mail is being delivered.  Actions that change
       the delivery time or destination are not available.

       This feature is available in Postfix 2.5 and later.

ssmmttpp__ccnnaammee__oovveerrrriiddeess__sseerrvveerrnnaammee ((ddeeffaauulltt:: vveerrssiioonn ddeeppeennddeenntt))
