       tent  with  the  SMTP limit of 1000 characters including <CR><LF>.  The
       Postfix limit was 990 with Postfix 2.8 and earlier.

ssmmttpp__mmaaiill__ttiimmeeoouutt ((ddeeffaauulltt:: 330000ss))
