       leases,  the  behavior  is as if this parameter is set to "no". Postfix
       3.7 and later use smtp_per_request_deadline.

ssmmttpp__ppeerr__rreeqquueesstt__ddeeaaddlliinnee ((ddeeffaauulltt:: nnoo))
