       one-letter suffix that specifies the time unit).  Time units:  s  (sec‐
       onds),  m  (minutes), h (hours), d (days), w (weeks).  The default time
       unit is s (seconds).

ssmmttpp__ppiixx__wwoorrkkaarroouunndd__mmaappss ((ddeeffaauulltt:: eemmppttyy))
