              >= 3.8 this cipher grade is always identical to  "medium".   Re‐
              cent  versions  of OpenSSL do not support any "EXPORT" grade ci‐
              phers.  In earlier Postfix releases  the  underlying  cipherlist
              was  specified via the tls_export_cipherlist configuration para‐
              meter, which you are strongly encouraged not  to  change.   This
              obsolete cipher grade SHOULD NOT be used.

