              quired  =  yes"  to  fully  enforce  this  restriction  (without
              "smtpd_helo_required   =   yes",   a   client  can  simply  skip
              check_helo_mx_access by not sending HELO or EHLO).  This feature
              is available in Postfix 2.1 and later.

