              the A record "_d_._d_._d_._d" under _r_b_l___d_o_m_a_i_n (Postfix version 2.1 and
              later only).  Each "_d" is a number, or  a  pattern  inside  "[]"
              that  contains one or more ";"-separated numbers or number..num‐
              ber ranges (Postfix version 2.8 and later).  If no "_=_d_._d_._d_._d" is
              specified, reject the request when the HELO or EHLO hostname  is
              listed   with  any  A  record  under  _r_b_l___d_o_m_a_i_n.  See  the  re‐
