       via  the  Postfix ssmmttppdd(8) server. Specify space or comma as separator.
       See the MILTER_README document for details.

       This feature is available in Postfix 2.3 and later.

ssmmttppdd__mmiinn__ddaattaa__rraattee ((ddeeffaauulltt:: 550000))
