              CPU exhaustion attack.  See SSSSLL__CCTTXX__sseett__ooppttiioonnss(3).

       NNOO__SSEESSSSIIOONN__RREESSUUMMPPTTIIOONN__OONN__RREENNEEGGOOTTIIAATTIIOONN
              Postfix >= 3.4. See SSSSLL__CCTTXX__sseett__ooppttiioonnss(3).

